{
  "name": "claudeconnect",
  "version": "2.13.0",
  "released": "2026-10-19",
  "notes": [
    "Remote, in the sidebar: see your computer's screen on the site and use its mouse and keyboard from any device, including a phone (tap to click, hold to right-click, slide to scroll). Turn it on from the Remote page or in Settings → This computer. On a Mac, the Mac asks once to allow Screen Recording and Accessibility for node.",
    "It now keeps running by itself: if the program on your computer crashes, is ended by the computer, or stops answering, it starts again within seconds and reconnects. Before, one unexpected error could take it offline until you started it again.",
    "On a Mac, the login item now also restarts it if it ever ends unexpectedly. What went wrong, and when the computer was asleep, now goes in the log (`<command> logs`)."
  ],
